      "content": "SP 90 SW               THE LEE              FIELD END LANE                                             (south side) 5/100                                       Barn to south east of                                             Hawthorn Farmhouse - GV\t\t\t\t\t    II                      Barn.  Early C18.  Timber framed and weatherboarded.  Brick and flint plinth.  Brick infill to upper level of east lean-to addition.  Old tile roof.  Three bays, central wagon entry.  South-east lean-to end storeyed east lean-to with tiled roof and flint plinth.  Raking queen post roof trusses, straight tiebeam braces.  Massive timbers to posts and tiebeams. Listing NGR: SP9006604208"
    }
